# The parity set: what a job can reasonably expect to find on ubuntu-24.04
# and the VM lacks, minus what setup actions give per job (actions/setup-node,
# setup-python, ...). Version-critical jobs still pin with those actions; this
# tracks noble's packages at provision time.
#
# Browsers are included through the other preset rather than copied here, so
# the twelve t64 names live in one file. The hooks beside this manifest add
# what apt cannot supply: AWS CLI v2 (noble has no awscli) and Node 22 (apt's
# nodejs is older; see docs/runbook.md "What the VM has").
include browsers

gh
shellcheck
sqlite3
xvfb
rsync
